Step 1: Distribute the cards into three piles (left, middle, right), each pile having no fewer than two cards and the same number of cards in each pile;  
Step 2: Take two cards from the left pile and put them into the middle pile;  
Step 3: Take one card from the right pile and put it into the middle pile;  
Step 4: Take the same number of cards from the middle pile as there are in the left pile and put them into the left pile.  
